      "observed": "TPS62933 VIN (U1.3) is connected directly to +24V. The TPS62933 input range is up to 17 V, so a nominal 24 V supply exceeds its operating rating.",
      "expected": "Use a regulator rated for the 24 V input, or reduce the voltage at U1.3 to within the TPS62933 input range.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"3\") (name \"+24V\") ... (node (ref \"U1\") (pin \"3\") (pinfunction \"VIN\")"
